# Tool caches
# Both tools also drop a self-ignoring .gitignore inside these directories, so
# git already skips them. Listing them here too means editors and other tools
# that only read the root .gitignore do not report thousands of phantom files.
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

